item.neko_hologram_projector.name=Neko Hologram Projector
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.0=Right-click opens the projector; right-click a real controller to import its structure.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.1=Select a blueprint and click Place; Alt-right-click previews your last selected blueprint directly.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.2=Right-click locks the green preview with cyan outlines; right-click again to review materials and confirm in the UI.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.3=Shift-right-click starts area selection; left/right sets corners; Ctrl adds, Ctrl+Shift subtracts, Ctrl+Z undoes.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.4=Area: Shift-right-click again finishes, Esc cancels. Locked preview: Shift-right-click unlocks; R / Ctrl+R turns a moving preview.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.5=UI: Ctrl-click selects multiple cells, Shift-drag selects a volume, Ctrl+X/C/V edits, RGB axes move.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.6=Select floating corners directly; Alt+scroll adjusts distance (0–64 blocks, 0 at your feet); ordinary scroll switches items. WASD moves the preview camera.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.7=Locked preview: arrows nudge one block relative to the view; Alt+Up/Down changes height; hold to repeat slowly, then right-click to review again.
